---
import { Image } from "astro:assets"
import manu from "./assets/manu.jpg"
import Rails from "./Rails.astro"
---

<section class="founder-quote">
    <Rails />
    <div class="container">
        <div class="frame">
            <figure class="quote">
                <div class="words">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 46 40" class="glyph" aria-hidden="true">
                        <path
                            d="M0 0v20.742h11.843c-.161 2.37-.822 6.365-3.33 9.113C6.543 32.01 3.757 33.06 0 33.06V40c5.683 0 10.228-1.823 13.513-5.417 4.062-4.446 5.244-10.484 5.422-13.835V0H0Z"
                        ></path>
                        <path
                            d="M27.06 0v20.742h11.842c-.161 2.37-.821 6.365-3.33 9.113-1.97 2.155-4.756 3.205-8.512 3.205V40c5.682 0 10.227-1.823 13.512-5.417 4.063-4.446 5.245-10.484 5.422-13.835V0H27.06Z"
                        ></path>
                    </svg>
                    <blockquote>
                        <p>
                            Every decade, one coordination problem grows large
                            enough to become its own category. Today, that
                            problem is orchestrating everything a company runs:
                            infrastructure, data, AI, business processes. We
                            started building Kestra before anyone gave it a
                            name, and we kept going. Now engineers at some of
                            the world's largest companies trust it with their
                            business-critical operations. Our goal is to lead
                            this market.
                        </p>
                    </blockquote>
                    <figcaption>
                        <span class="avatar">
                            <Image
                                src={manu}
                                alt=""
                                width={112}
                                densities={[1, 2]}
                            />
                        </span>
                        <span>
                            <strong>Emmanuel Darras</strong>
                            Co-founder and CEO
                        </span>
                    </figcaption>
                </div>
            </figure>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style lang="scss">
    @use "./style/section" as *;

    .founder-quote {
        position: relative;
        padding-bottom: 7.5rem;
        background: var(--ks-background-body);

        @include media-breakpoint-down(md) {
            padding-bottom: 4.5rem;
        }
    }

    .frame {
        --line: var(--ks-border-primary);
        --inset: 3rem;

        position: relative;
        margin: 0 calc(var(--inset) * -1);

        @include media-breakpoint-down(md) {
            --inset: 1.5rem;
        }

        &::before,
        &::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            left: -100vw;
            right: -100vw;
            height: 1px;
            background: var(--line);
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        &::before {
            top: 0;
        }

        &::after {
            bottom: 0;
        }
    }

    .quote {
        --surface: #f0f0fd;
        --glyph: #4f6df7;

        margin: 0;
        background: var(--surface);

        :global(html.dark) & {
            --surface: #1c1b2e;
            --glyph: #a796ff;
        }
    }

    .words {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 2.5rem;
        padding: 3rem var(--inset);

        .glyph {
            width: 2.25rem;
            height: 2rem;
            fill: var(--glyph);
            transform: scaleX(-1);
        }
    }

    blockquote {
        margin: 0;

        p {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.2vw, 1.875rem);
            font-weight: 500;
            line-height: 1.4;
            text-wrap: pretty;
            color: var(--ks-content-primary);
        }
    }

    figcaption {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 1rem;

        .avatar {
            flex-shrink: 0;
            width: 48px;
            height: 48px;
            overflow: hidden;

            :global(img) {
                display: block;
                width: 100%;
                height: auto;
                transform: scale(1.8);
                transform-origin: 50% 20%;
            }
        }

        span:not(.avatar) {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            font-size: $font-size-sm;
            line-height: 1.4;
            color: var(--ks-content-tertiary);
        }

        strong {
            font-size: $font-size-base;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--ks-content-primary);
        }
    }
</style>
